    "product_short_description": "<div class=\"advaya-product-details\">   <p class=\"lead-summary\">\n    <strong>Milky hydra-bright toner that plumps, evens tone, and\n      soothes sensitive skin.</strong>\n  </p>      <h3>Product Benefits</h3>   <div class=\"benefits-content\">\n      <p>Hydrates Deeply Without Stickiness<br/>Aloe Vera, Hyaluronic\n      Acid, and Sodium PCA quench thirsty skin for an instantly plump,\n      dewy finish.</p>\n    <p>Brightens &amp; Revives Dull Complexion<br/>Niacinamide, Vitamin\n      C, and Licorice Extract fade dark spots and promote an even skin tone.</p>\n    <p>Strengthens Skin Barrier<br/>Oat Lipids, Squalane, and Lecithin\n      fortify the natural lipid layer to prevent moisture loss and dryness.</p>\n    <p>Soothes &amp; Calms Sensitive Skin<br/>Centella Asiatica and Rose\n      Water relieve redness, irritation, and post-sun sensitivity.</p>\n    <p>Soft, Milky Texture for Everyday Luxury<br/>A silky,\n      semi-translucent finish that melts into skin \u2014 no greasy residue,\n      just fresh radiance.</p>\n    <p>Daily Glow Ritual<br/>Use morning and night to keep skin\n      balanced, luminous, and comfortably hydrated throughout the\n    day.</p>   </div>    <h3>How to Use &amp; Rituals</h3>   <div\n    class=\"usage-content\">     <p>When to Use:<br/>After cleansing (Step\n      2 of your skincare routine)<br/>Before serum or\n      moisturizer<br/>Suitable for AM &amp; PM use</p>\n    <p>How to Use:<br/>Pour a few drops onto palms or cotton\n      pad<br/>Gently pat over face &amp; neck until absorbed<br/>Follow\n      with your favorite Advaya Care serum or moisturizer</p>\n    <p>Best For:<br/>All skin types \u2014 especially dry, dull, sensitive,\n      and acne-prone<br/>Ideal for hot, humid Indian climates or\n      post-sun exposur</p>   </div>    <h3>Ingredients</h3>   <p class=\"ingredients-list\">\n    <em>Aqua (Distilled Water), Rosa Damascena (Rose) Flower Water, Aloe\n      Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Extract,\n      Niacinamide (Vitamin B3), Sodium PCA, Hyaluronic Acid, Ascorbyl\n      Glucoside (Vitamin C), Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil,\n      Squalane (Olive-derived), Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Lipid,\n      Lecithin, Polysorbate 20, Cetearyl Glucoside, Glycyrrhiza Glabra\n      (Licorice) Root Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Tocopherol\n      (Vitamin E), Lavandula Angustifolia (Lavender) Oil / Rosa\n      Damascena Oil / Santalum Album (Sandalwood) Oil [optional\n      fragrance], Dehydroacetic Acid &amp; Benzyl Alcohol (Eco-certified\n      preservative).  100% Vegan | No Parabens | No Silicones | No\n      Sulphates | Cruelty-Free</em>\n  </p>      <div class=\"product-guarantee\">     <p>? <strong>100% Vegan\n        &amp; Cruelty Free</strong> | ?\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Formulated for Indian\n      Skin</strong> | ? <strong>Safe &amp; Non-Toxic</strong>\n    </p>   </div> </div>",
